# Test Standards

## Canonical test.sh ending

```bash
python -m pytest --ctrf /logs/verifier/ctrf.json /tests/test_outputs.py -rA
rc=$?

if [ "$rc" -eq 0 ]; then
  echo 1 > /logs/verifier/reward.txt
else
  echo 0 > /logs/verifier/reward.txt
fi
```

- Reward block is the script end — **no trailing exit required**
- Capture `rc=$?` immediately after pytest
- No apt-get, curl, pip install in test.sh
- pytest + pytest-json-ctrf pre-installed in Docker image

## Coverage

Every explicit prompt requirement must map to a test.
Include implicit behavior and critical edge cases.

## Milestone

`test_mN.py` with `TestMilestoneN` class — scores only milestone N.
